<div><div>We’re listening to your feedback and made the following changes:&lt;br&gt;</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>&lt;br&gt;</div>
<div>200.72&lt;br&gt;</div>
<p>Fixed PO archive revisions signature DOC_DETAIL_PO_HEADER_ARCHIVE to calculate the revision totals correctly rather than showing current revision total values for all the other revisions. This signature initially showed only the latest revision. &nbsp;Then it was later revised to show older revisions as well. &nbsp;However, it was discovered that the totals were correct for the current revision, but not correct for the older revisions. &nbsp;Now this is fixed in version 200.72 of the analyzer</p><div>&lt;br&gt;</div>
