Fixed Consolidated Change Request Data - remove from the 2nd SELECT where clause--and plla.approved_flag = &apos;R&apos; -- because we do not need this restriction which causes some rows to not be retrieved&lt;br&gt;<br>
Updated sequence checks&lt;br&gt;<br>
Include Framework improvements for move to Fusion Service&lt;br&gt;<br>
&nbsp;</div>
<div>200.69&lt;br&gt;</div>
<p>Fix display of Document Type Details in Single Document Details to show data when using Job based approvals, or using Position based approvals but there is no default Position Hierarchy specified for the document type.&lt;br&gt;<br>
