200.63&lt;br&gt;<br>
- added approval list headers/lines data for Requisition approval list (this data is only available for iProcurement Requisitions)&lt;br&gt;<br>
- added new Section - Purchasing Specific Workflows - which will display when Procurement Approval Analyzer is run in ALL mode. This is similar to a section that was present in older versions of Workflow Analyzer. &nbsp;Since this section is removed from the latest version of Workflow Analyzer, we have added it here for a summary of checks and counts on Procurement workflows (PO, Requisition, Sourcing, iSupplier, Account Generator).&lt;br&gt;<br>
&lt;br&gt;</div>
<div><br>
200.62&lt;br&gt;</div>
<div>- Do not show Warning for Workflow Item Attribute Values when PO_PDF_ERROR is not null (This attribute will always have a value of the standard error message for PO PDF, so it is not indicating any kind of error on the document being approved.)&lt;br&gt;<br>
- Included PO related .xsl file versions from patch/115/publisher/templates directory in the File Versions section&lt;br&gt;<br>
- add description columns to show which data is from in PO Related Requisition Line(s) Source Doc(s) - PO Dist Data, Req Dist+ Line Data, and Souce Doc GBPA/CPA Header Data&lt;br&gt;<br>
- added check for missing UOM on Req or PO when running analyzer for Requisition&lt;br&gt;<br>
- include framework updates and a few other improvements</div>
<div>&lt;br&gt;</div>
