- Added check for Does Owner Have Authority to Approve to help with cases where Owner Can Approve is used&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</div>
<div>200.60&lt;br&gt;<br>
- Improve the signature that checks for role WF_EXTERNAL_ROLE_NOEBS_ACCESS missing from wf_local_roles table. &nbsp;Only check for this if instance is 12.2.9 and later.&lt;br&gt;<br>
- Improve the workflow customization check to detect more workflow customizations&lt;br&gt;<br>
- Add warning signature to detect AUTHORIZATION_STATUS = APPROVED, but approved_flag &lt;&gt; Y for PO header or shipment&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</div>
<div>200.59&lt;br&gt;<br>
- Display all data from po_change_requests table in the signatures for Open Change Requests for the document (PO, Req, Release)&lt;br&gt;<br>
- Display all data from po_doc_style_headers table for the style associated to the document&lt;br&gt;<br>
