<li>The list of recommended product patches are as of the date the script was written to show the patches not on this instance.</li>
<li>Please review the list to schedule and apply any patches as soon as possible</li>
<li>Refer to the Knowledge Article indicated for more information about each patch</li>
<li>If you have already applied a higher version, there is no need to apply the previous patches</li>
</ul>
';
