<li>Please review list above and schedule to apply any unappplied recommended Procurement RUP patches as soon as possible</li>
<li>Refer to the Knowledge article indicated for more information about each patch</li>
<li>See [222339/KB370175] Procurement Family Patch Release History (Including Latest Available Rollups) (KB370175)</li>
