      p_problem_descr          => 'Errored Activities or activities with unexpected RESULT found for the combination of Item Type / Item Key.',
      p_solution               => '<br>1. In some cases the errors may have been bypassed previously by restarting the approval without clearing out the errored workflows. Compare the date on the errored workflow activities with the dates on the document to determine if the error is current or from the past. If the error is from the past and already bypassed, consider the purge obsolete workflow option described in [458886/KB189542]. Otherwise, if this is a current error, proceed with the following steps to analyze further.
<br>2. Review the unexpected result or error details (Click the arrow above to show the details). In some cases you may see the error here and also in another more specific error message in this analyzer output. Compare with the other errors reported in this analyzer output to identify any duplicates.
<br>3. For unexpected result or errors reported only here, search for known solutions at My Oracle Support.
<br>4. Work with Support through an SR for more specific advice.
',
      p_success_msg            => 'No Errored Activities nor activities with unexpected RESULT found for the combination of Item Type / Item Key',
      p_print_condition        => nvl('ALWAYS','ALWAYS'),
      p_fail_type              => nvl('E','W'),
