</p></p>Wf_Item_Activity_Status.Result(REQAPPRV, NNNN-NNN, NNNN) Wf_Item_Activity_Status.Root_Status(REQAPPRV, NNNN-NNN) WF_ITEM.SetEndDate(REQAPPRV, NNNN-NNN) Wf_Item_Activity_Status.Create_Status(REQAPPRV, NNNN-NNN, NNNN, COMPLETE, NO_APPROVER_AVAILABLE) Wf_Engine_Util.Complete_Activity(REQAPPRV,....)
</p></p>
NOTE:  This only occurs when no approver is found in the approval list.  The error does NOT occur if approvers are found successfully.',
      p_solution               => '1) Review and apply Patch 23073357:R12.OWF.C.</p>
2) The other part of the issue is that No Approver Found is occurring , so the approval configuration needs to be checked and updated to ensure that an approver can be found when the user submits the PO for approval. 
</p></p>
Please review [2170639/KB227123] for more information regarding this issue and the corresponding patch.',
      p_success_msg            => 'There is no error for requisition approval like, ORA-06502 ... character string buffer too small ... NO_APPROVER_AVAILABLE, as described in [2170639/KB227123]',
