Use the expand all icon at the top of this section, and look (search) for the Supervisor id.  You will see the Person reports to the Supervisor, and also the Supervisor reports to the Person.  This is the loop, and it causes problems with approvals.',
      p_solution               => 'Please review - [290365/KB368390] Troubleshooting Document For Build Default Approval List Failure (KB368390) - section 3 and section 8 for more details on how to troubleshoot and resolve this issue of a loop in the hierarchy.  It requires modifying your setup so that there is no loop - no Person reporting to Supervisor, where the Supervisor reports to that same Person.',
      p_success_msg            => 'There is no invalid looping in the hierarchy setup. (no occurrence of a Person reporting to a Supervisor, where the Supervisor also reports to the Person)',
      p_print_condition        => nvl('FAILURE','ALWAYS'),
      p_fail_type              => nvl('W','W'),
