There are NO ROWS found in the HISTORY table (wf_item_activity_statuses_h) for Purchasing that have over 500 rows associated to the same item_key.
This is a good result, which means there are no major looping issues at this time.',
      p_print_condition        => nvl('FAILURE','ALWAYS'),
      p_fail_type              => nvl('I','W'),
      p_print_sql_output       => nvl('RS','RS'),
      p_limit_rows             => nvl('Y','Y'),
      p_extra_info             => l_info,
