    ORDER BY l.revision_num desc, l.line_num',
      p_title                  => 'PO Line Archive Details (Highest Revision(s))',
      p_fail_condition         => 'NRS',
      p_problem_descr          => 'No document line archive data found for document number ##$$DOCNUM$$##!',
      p_solution               => '<p>There is no archive data for the PO Line.  Approve or Transmit (Print/Fax/Email) the Purchase Order to see data in the archive table.</p>
<p>Reference: <b>[1638338/KB663801] - Difference in Behavior when ''Archive On'' is set to ''Transmission'' or ''Approve''</b>.</p>',
