<li><b>PO Header Details</b> - AUTHORIZATION_STATUS and PRINT_COUNT</li>
</ul>
</p>
<p>Depending on which setup you are using per the above referenced document, Approve or Transmit (Print/Fax/Email) the Purchase Order to see data in the archive table.</p>',
      p_success_msg            => '<p>Archive record for PO Number ##$$DOCNUM$$##.</p>
<p>Reference: <b>[1638338/KB663801] - Difference in Behavior when ''Archive On'' is set to ''Transmission'' or ''Approve''</b>.  This document provides clarification about the archive functionality depending on the Document Type setup where the ''Archive On'' setting is specified.</p>',
      p_print_condition        => nvl('ALWAYS','ALWAYS'),
