      p_fail_condition         => 'RS',
      p_problem_descr          => 'Your code version for PO Approval workflow (poxwfpoa.wft) and/or Requisition Approval workflow (poxwfrqa.wft) are lower than these version(s) released in 2017.
<p>poxwfpoa.wft    120.51.12020000.50</p>
<p>poxwfrqa.wft    120.38.12020000.22</p>
<p>Expand the row to see which workflow version(s) is lower.</p>',
      p_solution               => 'Please consider upgrading PO Approval workflow (poxwfpoa.wft) and / or Requisition Approval workflow (poxwfrqa.wft) to newer versions by applying the latest RUP per [222339/KB370175]',
      p_success_msg            => 'PO Approval workflow file (poxwfpoa.wft) and Requisition Approval workflow file (poxwfrqa.wft) versions are greater than or equal to the versions released in 2017.  Review the section "PO and AME File versions" / "Workflow File (WFT) Versions" of the analyzer output to see your current file versions for these files.',
